  "title": "Barbacoa-Style Shredded Beef",
  "description": "This barbacoa recipe makes tender, shredded beef in a spicy barbacoa sauce, and it's super easy to make with this slow cooker recipe. Great for tacos.",
  "authors": [
    "Jack Grigsby III"
  ],
